# The files of the package uc-pxx-leds (later an aports package of the category
# uc-pxx). The source tree is root/: each path below is the install path in the
# image, with the mode of the file. tests/test-package.sh checks that this list
# and the tree are the same.
#
# Depends (apk): python3, openrc, uc-pxx-boot-tools (the program
# /usr/sbin/uc-pxx-bootctl, run with the argument "status" only).
# Optional: tsx-esphome or tsx-voice from tsx-linux-common (they load the
# plugin from /usr/local/share/tsx/esphome.d).
# Conflicts: no other program may write the LED class devices teams_white,
# mute_headset, mute_speaker, mute_red, green and blue. The boot-control scripts
# of uc-pxx-board may write red, as an alarm (docs/leds.md). tsx-buttons has no
# LEDs on this board (buttons-board.conf of uc-pxx-board).
# The config file is a conffile: an upgrade keeps the file of the user.
#
# mode  path
0755 usr/local/sbin/uc-pxx-leds
0755 usr/local/bin/uc-pxx-led
0755 etc/init.d/uc-pxx-leds
0644 etc/tsx/uc-pxx-leds.conf
0644 usr/local/share/tsx/esphome.d/uc-pxx-leds.py
